  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `nuke_build_helpers` from `6.3.30` to `7.0.1`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/compare/nuke_build_helpers/6.3.30...nuke_build_helpers/7.0.1)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Added interactive CLI for local tasks by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/199\n* Added other task to interactive by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/200\n* Disabled bump if UseJsonFileVersioning is enabled by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/201\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/compare/build.532...build.536",
